# Discourse Analyzer AI - Project Roadmap

## 🔴 Critical Issues & Bugs
- [ ] Youtube transcription fetch don't work from server, due to YouTube protection against API calls. Use Gemini?
- [ ] **CRITICAL:** Total data loss detected! (Started with 675 lines, ended with 235 lines. Lost 440 lines).
- [x] Quote analysis does not use correct analysis categories according to selected analysis type.
- [ ] Re-evaluating quote does not use latest updated context content.
- [ ] Analysis cleanup may not be working correctly; refresh session data everywhere after cleanup or update.

## 🛡️ Security & DDoS Protection
- [ ] **Edge Protection:** Configure Web Application Firewall (WAF) rules (e.g., Cloudflare/Vercel) to block known botnets.
- [ ] **Smart CAPTCHA:** Implement Cloudflare Turnstile on session creation/login to stop bot floods.
- [ ] **Session Hardening:**
    - [ ] Generate session IDs for anonymous users immediately to enable tracking.
    - [ ] Implement strict throttling on the session creation endpoint.
    - [ ] Enforce short TTL (Time-To-Live) for unauthenticated sessions to prevent storage exhaustion.
    - [ ] Cache active sessions in Redis for sub-millisecond validation.
- [x] **Payload Safety:** Enforce strict JSON body limits (e.g., 10kb) on all APIs.
- [ ] Add email/webhook notifications for critical alerts.
- [ ] Add WebSocket for real-time alert updates.

## 🎙️ Transcription & Dialog Analysis
### Normalize GUI flows:
- [ ] Session stage
- [ ] Promoted stage

### Improvements:
- [x] Support translations for dynamic analysis categories.
- [x] Improve audit verdict prompt (currently ambiguous) or remove it.
- [ ] Allow saving session state multiple times.
- [ ] Allow selection of specific AI models for different analysis stages:
    - Rough grouping analysis
    - Speaker identification
    - Dialog analysis into topics
    - Topic merging

## 👥 User & Access Management
- [x] Use DB-stored API keys instead of environment variables.
- [x] Implement Role-Based Access Control (RBAC) for the admin dashboard.

## 📜 Public Quotes
- [ ] **Create and Manage Public Quotes**
    - [ ] **Prerequisite:** Mechanism to mark quotes as public/private with audit history (logging who changed status).
    - [ ] **Permissions:** Changing quote status is restricted to roles: `admin`, `editor`, `moderator`.
    - [ ] **Management API:** Specific API for changing status with proper role authorization.
    - [ ] **Fetch API:** Special API for fetching public quotes.
        - [ ] Strict filtering only; no free-text search (security risk).
        - [ ] Filter by Person: Send person ID only, not the full object.
    - [ ] **Public View:** Separate view for public quotes.
        - [ ] Design with support for different viewing layouts.
        - [ ] Architecture to allow easy future expansion and adoption of different layouts.

## 📺 Media & Display
- [ ] **TikTok:** Support loading videos from URL.
- [x] **Previews:** Do not activate embedded previews (e.g., Facebook) until the user clicks the "Load Preview" button.

