## ✅ Completed Tasks

### Security
- [x] Redis-based rate limiting (express-rate-limit + rate-limit-redis)
- [x] IP blocking middleware with auto-block capability
- [x] API usage tracking and logging to MongoDB
- [x] Security alerts system for suspicious activity
- [x] Admin dashboard for usage stats and alerts
- [x] Admin alert banner with real-time notifications
- [x] Ensure every API call checks user role and permissions
- [x] Define required roles for each API endpoint
- [x] Store API role configurations in DB
- [x] On application start, register all API endpoints in DB; register missing endpoints with default admin role
- [x] Create DB migration to add role-based access control to existing users

### Dialog Analysis
- [x] Group 5min chunks by 30s parts with timestamps.
- [x] Speaker identification with timestamps and 30-45s overlap.
- [x] Timestamps provided for speaker identification input lines.
- [x] Timestamps provided for topic analysis lines.
- [x] UI: Edit list of speakers and update functionality.
- [x] UI: Replace strength texts with "horizontal bars" (segments for levels, hover for tooltip).

### User Management
- [x] Role assignments to users.
- [x] Admin form for entering extra keysets for users.
- [x] Admin ability to assign keysets to users.

### Quote Features
- [x] Facebook embedded iframe for Facebook quotes.
- [x] Different "flavors" of quote analysis: fact check, toxicity.
- [x] Bugfix: Person name is now correctly sent for quote analysis.